          "videoUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6d28e4b2713f4243b7ad415c454171c6_MEC-IDM_MODB2-CAP_17-AULA_01-ESP.mp4?Expires=1794099821&Signature=zt~EydHpiw6kiIeNNugM~7FjBBVBNLkRNU31BUh-iLy6YoaWrV86S-uk2zanSug56PujAKgmYGnyiyaax43Dq1PH965RvcGcurzQRu2YBEAL1j7Q1ElfRY1R1PrJCEthg8UoDRME9YXvs61Va4JUIB0i5bWidXhLYV-cfjJhtnoAXEzkpaAEn2CycXy~jaWllXykwP4~0pErLxbLByxOftueE8xJMUgS9R0~Ia9~kq7KsWz-Fh2iLTy~2kqprqPa8dNipYtkdCJPki0Qf6t-R3Er90lG7yFd2BfZpT26~BXhzvksXEO08qs7pgBLwbbyPFHv8HgoCAYUspYrzAC2GA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
