    {
      "id": "79196b2f-3905-41a3-92fb-e442b2d5a01a",
      "title": "Leia o contraste e observe o núcleo fixo da estrutura. Repare também no papel de no.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "368602f5-45d3-4329-a5d3-9b1c1c08f6c6",
          "textContent": "<p>O núcleo da aula é <strong>ojalá + hubiera + particípio</strong>.</p><p><strong>hubiera revisado</strong> fala de algo que a pessoa <strong>gostaria de ter feito</strong>. <strong>no hubiera reaccionado</strong> fala de algo que ela <strong>gostaria de não ter feito</strong>.</p><p>Sem <strong>no</strong>, o foco costuma cair numa ação que faltou. Com <strong>no</strong>, o arrependimento recai sobre uma ação que aconteceu rápido demais, cedo demais ou do jeito errado.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c98bce2b-548c-486c-ac46-5817991dac90",
      "title": "Quando o arrependimento entra na conversa",
      "description": "<p>O diálogo entra agora para mostrar a estrutura num comentário curto e natural, sem transformar a cena numa história longa.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿Ya hablaste con tu hermana?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Você já falou com a sua irmã?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/0a438f7158944b0fad5e0ec73ff3baf7_b06-d01-ya-hablaste-con-tu-hermana.mp3?Expires=1794099821&Signature=twhIqqq2p~Ec7DZH~0xADMn1G0A6yVG70C~3aJF1vZkmspMzvNw0jaWxZpZn202IqNX1sX2e-n2La7Aoo9LHw54D2rwXPp6Vs2DFtPhBdEHUPvjxgwmsJvM3kvl8vtAACss89oqD-6s848MtdrOBYZYS-FBPTYca9bwYpi6xUASIqGp6EARmoF2v7Lt2xfwuu1vUT1EAlcpYL3V4zAlPlnaGfVOfQ2ZO9CF~DXGNfuDF-1Kz9WoTFDjD~2VefnB5HEspI1O5kmQ~S8AgVQ4Q3MITE6j4JoZKGFaPar5Ahdwsdiko1W-69hk4ooLA7bdBXl1s47SdgbQMVGLjkPp-Hg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Sí, pero todo terminó peor de lo que esperaba.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Sim, mas tudo terminou pior do que eu esperava.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/08c9d316b5cc49a6a9c3876f74df0d5d_b06-d02-todo-termino-peor-de-lo-que-esperaba.mp3?Expires=1794099821&Signature=CfisfnuwqlvaRu00hXb~pygOlzSFeKwJT634lE5tjaaWq3HBI558nz4rcxC23YyIQ1m6ARwMIhworN0RBFEz~bkyPWUSIv1HSaNRoAD~dMwnzJ0w-ndCXpbsulszGGPJaFs1TlKNep6RRa4UEUueqx4mqEpM9-XteFAV7BQQFrMXa8VdROi~C7~vNqKhU2GTGDRAslA3nf6~H759PvWgfUQXm7hmrOzujY4Pr4OCgRHSHSGkfRUFQUMSzgpLZDfnnVPpYGILuFiZBsQ3WamM~q3HLq51hwST-f1g9ikkeYFF50kNzqrnfdGyYZby2QbEW4JLmvOqig~HT3dI1zp~Vg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Qué pena.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Que pena.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7ab0768080384b61abfa8e3cbf6cb62b_b06-d03-que-pena.mp3?Expires=1794099821&Signature=y6B1RvhvFXjRtrPjL-nNXLMtN8fIogwSUUjBYJzzyFDJ2HCgaTYdRbrtu9lW4xj6ZLQTLN1~PjIbtuuzCputHbgcXRkVuw3mGTqLapjyYkrKmNwTAC6a9GiFMTD24anoDNyWXaq80k6uR-sM8cf~-jmXT-k264l-JWiy0oZ8jWm4~s9eiaFrpvyaiWtIqGQmXf25Wuv-SUzKd2w3yPfGDxh5fDAT9I6rE1jHDnGkOVQ0JpZOl31pAFJQhoS1H1Xsgzr5xNTqqztr6vUFC8FZJmGDK~yr2byaw63rXa9RDF5mW38xa9unvQUFlvrabMCA0vQcC7FMTaFeR1FPMVqvCg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Ojalá no hubiera reaccionado tan rápido.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Tomara que eu não tivesse reagido tão rápido.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b59d2bb488d648f4b783851c4b93d6a7_b04-ojala-no-hubiera-reaccionado-tan-rapido.mp3?Expires=1794099821&Signature=Y5FJ1JYm103RodPS-gF6KbU2uv8ElrzgLQY0yXqeSvcbc75mZXG9POvF8KlwAAPFCYJP4U7aCiSn7uN0POpeF1bm-Ed70cQpnRlidhE2M75wgCtEAjtH3A6JZJEAUUye4njhppLkxF3My394Yy1ek~IqYU5wQnqmdWQV~qZPeqwvAIPcfSpNf95c94byg1VJwodX4zHEWy1eDXpfv9Oicz1UJ3wvb65vXXR0hxs8BTJ7NIlezGHxaJRg2Mp0cZG88aaoB0~nkurJiHUscEJNor2JFpRaqlWRLD-Ik0yhrTwX7vDl5GRQXKLLsLO-JKqsgdmEJcaQI5oKUyyRyWxP2Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
